{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Silence guards memories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Voices Died</strong> is an atmospheric narrative puzzle game where each puzzle connects fragments of a story about loss, regret, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an ethereal world, the player explores distorted memories and forgotten sounds, rebuilding paths between what was and what could still be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/8ea526e334f7856a78da9654bf60409b.poster.avif?t=1770644783\" width=764 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/8ea526e334f7856a78da9654bf60409b.webm?t=1770644783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Puzzles:</strong> Solve challenges using hexagonal tiles that fit together to form paths and open new areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Challenges:</strong> Discover numerical combinations, reassemble broken objects, and interpret subtle clues hidden in the scenery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensory Exploration:</strong> Sounds of wind, rain, and piano guide the journey, creating an emotional and immersive experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poetic and Minimalist Environment:</strong> A white, symbolic world that reveals itself as the player progresses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Narrative:</strong> Told through echoes, whispers, and visual fragments that awaken forgotten memories and feelings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delicate Art Style:</strong> Soft lighting, serene colors, and fluid transitions that reflect the protagonist's emotional state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/51ffec5e64105b0331baddd6ca1e34c6.poster.avif?t=1770644783\" width=764 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/51ffec5e64105b0331baddd6ca1e34c6.webm?t=1770644783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Voices Died</strong> invites introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is not just a challenge, but a metaphor\u2014a step towards rebuilding what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is part of the narrative, and every sound, every visual fragment, carries meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than winning, the goal is to feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/9df318d1d5e14d84ffa2e22a5b99851e.poster.avif?t=1770644783\" width=764 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/extras/9df318d1d5e14d84ffa2e22a5b99851e.webm?t=1770644783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151540?t=1770644783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151540/d611c91bce9c13df205a4e71a40943b7553023cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770644783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st